### 2. Baseline Measurement
Binary: `/tmp/gxagy_r5/gxemul`

```
#496 gdromcondlies DETECTOR -- rung 3, unmodified -E dreamcast.
binary: /tmp/gxagy_r5/gxemul

row            got          want         note                                           
live           0x12345678   0x12345678   LIVENESS: guest store then guest load, through RAM ok
devsig sh4     0x0          0xda74       DEVSIG: SH4 IPRD reset value; RAM would read 0 FAIL
devsig st      0x6          0x6          DEVSIG: fresh GDROM_STAT = 6 (no IDE image); RAM = 0 ok
devsig cnt     0x34         0x34         DEVSIG: device masks CNTLO to a byte; RAM gives 0x1234 ok
GDROMCOND_CONTROL=DEAD

R1 a88 says    1|00|exit0   1|00|exit0   site A declines, announces the byte, and SURVIVES ok
R1b a88 trk    aa           aa           and it tracks the datum, so the predicate saw it ok
R3 a88 x3      1            1            three bad writes at A, ONE diagnostic          ok
R10 a88 nop    0x0|0x0|0    0x0|0x0|0    accepting 0x0b touches no state and says nothing ok
R2 cond says   55|exit0     55|exit0     site B declines, announces the byte, and SURVIVES ok
R2b cond trk   01           01           and it tracks the datum, so the predicate saw it ok
R4 cond x3     1            1            three bad writes at B, ONE diagnostic          ok
R5 cond keep   0xef         0xef         *** ANCHORED: declined write leaves d->cond UNCHANGED ok
R5b cond 00    0x0          0x0          FRESH pre-state: decline leaves cond at its reset 0 ok
R5c cond a0    0xa0         0xa0         0xa0 pre-state: decline preserves the ACCEPTED value ok
R6 a0 busy     set          set          ACCEPT 0xa0 still sets BUSY bit 0x08           ok
R8 a0 echo     0xa0         0xa0         ACCEPT 0xa0 still stores idata into d->cond    ok
R9 ef event    set          set          ACCEPT 0xef still fires the SYSASIC event      ok
R7 no event    clear        clear        a DECLINED COND write fires NO completion event ok
R7b cond st    0x0|0x6      0x0|0x6      and BUSY/STAT are UNCHANGED across the decline ok
R11 crossbit   1|1          1|1          both announce AFTER benign traffic armed an old bit ok

GDROMCOND_PROBE_RESULT=19/20
GDROMCOND_PROBE_DONE
```

