## AGY JOB 2 — RUNG-3 WITNESS FOR ACCESS WIDTH DEFECT

**VERDICT: YES, RUNG-3 WITNESS ACHIEVED (10/10 PASS).**

### 1. Site Selection & Machine Mapping
- **Target Site**: [`src/devices/dev_sgi_re.c`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/build/src/devices/dev_sgi_re.c#L231-L234) line 231 `len != 8` guard on `CRIME_RE_TLB_A`:
  `if (len != 8) { fatal("TODO: unimplemented len=%i for CRIME_RE_TLB_A\n", len); exit(1); }`
- **Machine**: `-E sgi -e ip32` (SGI O2, MIPS R10000, 64-bit Big-Endian).
- **Guest Address**: Instantiated by `dev_sgi_re_init(machine, mem, 0x15000000)` at `0x15001000` (`DEV_SGI_RE_LENGTH = 0x1000`), accessed directly via MIPS kseg1 address `0xb5001000`.

