| 14 | `[ sgi_de: UNIMPLEMENTED drawing op =` | BADVAL | **REACHABLE** | Write unimplemented drawing op to `CRIME_DE_PRIMITIVE` and trigger with `CRIME_DE_START` (`0x0800`). |
